# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirect rules.
#
# Public install one-liner:
#
#   curl -fsSL https://computer.police.dev/install | bash
#
# /install is a 302 redirect to scripts/install.sh on the main branch of
# the GitHub repository. curl -fsSL follows redirects, so the pipe-to-bash
# flow lands on the canonical script with no copy in this directory.
#
# Format: <from> <to> [status]
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/install   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vidocsecurity/computer-police/main/scripts/install.sh   302
